You may measure your own workspace before you reply: call `submit_evaluation` on the
`evaluation` tool. The framework decides whether the submission is admitted and
counts it against the run's budget; a refusal names the reason, so change the
workspace or stop submitting. A successful call returns a handle. To wait for the
result, call `validate_evaluation_wait` with every handle you need, then finish the
turn with only `{"kind":"waiting_for_evaluation","handles":["<handle>"]}`. Do not
poll: the host resumes this same session once every listed measurement is terminal.
A waiting turn uses no new attempt.
